00023:       "status": "INDEPENDENT_COUNTER_REVIEW_COMPLETE_ROOT_ADJUDICATION_PENDING",
00024:       "finding_narrowing": "The actual defect is an inconsistent ability example/name, not an explicit numeric clause assigning TRUANT -1. WP48 already gives the correct complete identity table. Do not characterize the linked specification as wholly lacking the sorting rule or claim a runtime defect.",
00025:       "decision_reason": "WP40 §5.4 and §5.2.1 consistently use 懒惰 for the alternating refusal ability; WP49 expressly pairs TRUANT with 懒惰. WP40 §6.1 then uses 如懒惰类 as a bracket-changing example. The same document therefore invites a different identity from the correct WP48 table. Required correction can be one in-place identifier substitution; no new combat rule is needed.",
00026:       "counter_arguments": [
00027:         {
00028:           "attempt": "Read full linked WP48 and WP40 instead of isolating one sentence.",
00029:           "result": "PARTLY_SUCCESSFUL_NARROWING",
00030:           "reason": "WP48 §3/§9 uniquely names QUICKDRAW/STALL for bracket changes and states their values. An informed integrated reader can resolve the intended ability to STALL. This prevents a claim of missing global mechanics and limits severity to P3, but does not make the same-document reused name correct."
00031:         },
00032:         {
00033:           "attempt": "Treat 懒惰类 as a generic description of slow behavior rather than TRUANT.",
00034:           "result": "REJECTED_AS_COMPLETE_REBUTTAL",
00035:           "reason": "Within WP40 the exact Chinese name already labels the alternate-turn action gate, so that reading requires silently changing the local terminology. A data identity STALL removes ambiguity without translation research."
00036:         },
00037:         {
00038:           "attempt": "TRUANT may alter order indirectly through skip/priority.",
00039:           "result": "REJECTED_FOR_BRACKET",
00040:           "reason": "The real receiver queries the current effective ability during full sorting. Missing registration returns0; direct TRUANT refusal occurs later after status/obedience. Such refusal is not bracket -1."
00041:         }
